100
00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:37.910
I feel like my grandmother would be so proud.

101
00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:43.950
Well, now it is time for our chit-chat question of the week, and it's coming from Amy H.

102
00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:45.790
in Santa Clarita, California.

103
00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:48.350
