247
00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:24.710
And she was like, Jenna, I'm Amy.

248
00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:26.250
I'm body fit by Amy.

249
00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:28.350
You post my videos on your Instagram.

250
00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:28.970
Oh, my God.

251
00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:29.950
And I was like, what?

252
00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:30.870
You live here?

253
00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:32.730
She's like, yeah, I live here.

254
00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.110
