00:52:57.640 --> 00:52:58.940
And he's so good in it.

1283
00:52:59.060 --> 00:52:59.720
He's perfect.

1284
00:52:59.880 --> 00:53:00.680
Really, really good.

1285
00:53:00.960 --> 00:53:03.200
We also got a question from Martina B.

1286
00:53:03.340 --> 00:53:04.420
in Denver who said,

1287
00:53:04.520 --> 00:53:07.400
I was wondering if you all had any catfish stories.

1288
00:53:08.100 --> 00:53:10.900
Or was there ever a time when a friend of yours was like,

1289
00:53:10.900 --> 00:53:15.480
oh, I saw someone pretending to be you catfishing other people?

1290
00:53:15.660 --> 00:53:17.500
Well, you know, that's interesting, Martina.

1291
00:53:17.700 --> 00:53:23.100
I feel like we both have had people pretend to be us on Instagram.

1292
00:53:23.180 --> 00:53:24.460
I've had that before.

1293
00:53:24.680 --> 00:53:25.560
Like a fake account.

1294
00:53:25.660 --> 00:53:25.940
Yeah.

1295
00:53:25.940 --> 00:53:27.680
But it doesn't say it's a fan account.

1296
00:53:27.680 --> 00:53:29.140
It says that's you.

1297
00:53:29.520 --> 00:53:31.740
And they find photos of you and post them.

1298
00:53:31.960 --> 00:53:32.100
Yeah.

1299
00:53:32.100 --> 00:53:34.420
And everybody has always been really nice.

1300
00:53:34.520 --> 00:53:37.040
Like if someone comes across that, they tell me.

1301
00:53:37.340 --> 00:53:39.360
And then I can be like, hey, guys, that's not me.

1302
00:53:39.560 --> 00:53:41.120
So I have had that.

1303
00:53:41.440 --> 00:53:46.820
But we asked Mo, the writer, if she'd ever been catfished because she wrote this episode.

1304
00:53:46.820 --> 00:53:48.860
And she has, you guys.

1305
00:53:49.080 --> 00:53:52.520
She said, I have been scammed so many times.

1306
00:53:53.680 --> 00:53:57.520
She says, I'm just a dumb girl from normal Illinois.

1307
00:53:57.520 --> 00:54:02.020
She actually highlighted one scam that happened to her and her wife, Samantha.

1308
00:54:02.380 --> 00:54:06.900
I guess they got pulled into this frozen yogurt scam in West Hollywood.

1309
00:54:07.340 --> 00:54:09.200
It happened when they were first dating.

1310
00:54:09.260 --> 00:54:14.460
But this scam, this yogurt scam ended up taking them all the way to Vegas.

1311
00:54:14.760 --> 00:54:15.300
Yes.

1312
00:54:15.520 --> 00:54:17.940
And she says she has a nickname for her wife.

1313
00:54:18.080 --> 00:54:19.700
She calls her Scam-Mantha.

1314
00:54:20.680 --> 00:54:21.260
Yes.

1315
00:54:21.260 --> 00:54:27.920
Well, Mo went on to say that she has been trying to find a place to force the storyline into something.

1316
00:54:27.920 --> 00:54:32.300
And she was so glad she got to put this catfishing idea into an episode.

1317
00:54:33.400 --> 00:54:36.820
My identity has been used to try to catfish someone.

1318
00:54:37.360 --> 00:54:41.920
And I'm actually happy that I can talk about it because I haven't known how to let people know.

1319
00:54:42.120 --> 00:54:47.260
This person let my manager know that they had received an email.

1320
00:54:47.480 --> 00:54:48.900
And here's what the email said.

1321
00:54:48.900 --> 00:54:51.440
It said, hi, I hope you're doing well.

1322
00:54:51.540 --> 00:54:54.560
My name is Liam Carter, and I manage Jenna Fisher.

1323
00:54:54.840 --> 00:54:55.720
This is not true.

1324
00:54:56.040 --> 00:54:57.860
My manager's name is Naomi Odenkirk.

1325
00:54:58.080 --> 00:54:59.740
Nobody named Liam Carter.

1326
00:55:00.280 --> 00:55:00.900
Represents you.

1327
00:55:01.120 --> 00:55:01.920
Represents me in any way.

1328
00:55:02.780 --> 00:55:04.520
Listen to what they said in their email.

1329
00:55:05.040 --> 00:55:10.840
Liam, fake Liam, says, we're excited to invite you to be a guest on Jenna's podcast,

1330
00:55:11.000 --> 00:55:13.840
Office Ladies, which she hosts with Angela Kinsey.

1331
00:55:13.980 --> 00:55:14.900
Oh, my gosh.

1332
00:55:15.460 --> 00:55:16.880
This is a paid opportunity.

1333
00:55:16.880 --> 00:55:20.220
We will offer you $2,000 for your participation.

1334
00:55:20.880 --> 00:55:27.480
The interview will be conducted virtually via Facebook and run approximately 30 to 45 minutes.

1335
00:55:27.860 --> 00:55:33.420
So this person sent this email to someone and then...

1336
00:55:33.420 --> 00:55:36.100
Yeah, so they did it to another person, too.

1337
00:55:36.280 --> 00:55:41.860
And what they're doing is they are targeting writers of books.

1338
00:55:41.960 --> 00:55:44.560
I think probably lesser-known authors.

1339
00:55:44.800 --> 00:55:48.440
They're going out and they're saying, Jenna loved your book.

1340
00:55:48.440 --> 00:55:51.220
And she wants you to be a guest on Office Ladies.

1341
00:55:51.660 --> 00:55:54.980
But then they say that the interview happens on Facebook Live.

1342
00:55:55.140 --> 00:55:55.680
That's another thing.

1343
00:55:55.720 --> 00:55:56.760
I don't have that.

1344
00:55:56.940 --> 00:55:57.200
Yeah.

1345
00:55:57.200 --> 00:55:59.080
We don't have Facebook.

1346
00:55:59.480 --> 00:55:59.940
No.

1347
00:56:00.140 --> 00:56:00.300
Yeah.

1348
00:56:00.480 --> 00:56:03.340
We might get Facebook, but we're not on Facebook right now.

1349
00:56:03.340 --> 00:56:07.740
Yeah, we might someday have an Office Ladies official Facebook, but we don't.

1350
00:56:07.800 --> 00:56:08.220
I know.

1351
00:56:08.380 --> 00:56:09.160
It's just bandwidth.

1352
00:56:09.840 --> 00:56:15.680
But what's confusing to me is they're offering to pay the author $2,000 to come on the podcaSt.

1353
00:56:15.840 --> 00:56:16.380
And I'm like, what?

1354
00:56:16.520 --> 00:56:17.500
I don't understand.

1355
00:56:17.820 --> 00:56:18.800
What's the catch here?

1356
00:56:18.940 --> 00:56:19.520
I know.

1357
00:56:19.520 --> 00:56:25.500
Oh, also, the email address that these are coming from is a Gmail address.

1358
00:56:25.680 --> 00:56:31.820
So I also just want to say to everybody out there, if someone who says they're representing

1359
00:56:31.820 --> 00:56:36.200
Office Ladies or me personally, they're not going to have a Gmail address.

1360
00:56:36.400 --> 00:56:41.940
They're going to have an Odyssey email address, or they're going to have a William Morris Endeavor

1361
00:56:42.580 --> 00:56:43.620
email address.

1362
00:56:44.140 --> 00:56:48.280
All of my representatives have their own whatever those are called.

1363
00:56:48.280 --> 00:56:51.520
Like a corporate server.

1364
00:56:51.900 --> 00:56:52.140
Yes.

1365
00:56:52.140 --> 00:56:52.280
Yes.

1366
00:56:52.500 --> 00:56:53.100
Exactly.

1367
00:56:53.440 --> 00:56:54.740
I mean, they got specific.

1368
00:56:55.060 --> 00:56:59.100
They sent a letter to another author that said,

1369
00:56:59.160 --> 00:57:04.020
Jenna admires your heartfelt storytelling and would be honored to host you for a virtual

1370
00:57:04.020 --> 00:57:08.660
Facebook Live podcast between July 22nd and 30th at 8 p.m.

1371
00:57:08.880 --> 00:57:09.000
Eastern.

1372
00:57:09.360 --> 00:57:12.720
What happens if these people show up to the Facebook Live?

1373
00:57:12.880 --> 00:57:13.960
What's waiting for them?

1374
00:57:14.100 --> 00:57:14.920
That's what I said.

1375
00:57:14.920 --> 00:57:15.620
We're not there.

1376
00:57:15.940 --> 00:57:17.680
What's Liam doing with this?

1377
00:57:17.680 --> 00:57:18.680
I don't know.

1378
00:57:18.860 --> 00:57:20.860
I had my lawyer look into it.

1379
00:57:20.980 --> 00:57:25.780
We looked into it, and it never really made any sense to me.

1380
00:57:25.860 --> 00:57:27.960
I didn't understand the end game here.

1381
00:57:28.340 --> 00:57:30.660
But everybody, it's not me.

1382
00:57:30.800 --> 00:57:33.120
And also, that's not how we do things.

1383
00:57:33.320 --> 00:57:37.720
But I'm looking at the emails, and they look very professional.

1384
00:57:37.960 --> 00:57:38.960
They look very official.

1385
00:57:39.920 --> 00:57:40.440
Yeah.

1386
00:57:40.440 --> 00:57:41.180
So weird.

1387
00:57:41.480 --> 00:57:41.880
I know.

1388
00:57:42.080 --> 00:57:45.040
So yeah, my identity has been used.

1389
00:57:45.040 --> 00:57:45.520
Yeah.

1390
00:57:46.200 --> 00:57:47.300
Which bothers me.

1391
00:57:47.420 --> 00:57:48.040
I don't like that.

1392
00:57:48.620 --> 00:57:49.780
I don't like that either.

1393
00:57:50.320 --> 00:57:55.340
We've talked to a lot of friends, even our fellow castmates and different projects we've

1394
00:57:55.340 --> 00:57:55.740
worked on.

1395
00:57:55.840 --> 00:58:00.840
And a lot of people do have people posing online as them at some point.

1396
00:58:01.060 --> 00:58:01.320
Yeah.

1397
00:58:01.460 --> 00:58:02.180
And DMing.

1398
00:58:02.180 --> 00:58:02.940
Yes.

1399
00:58:03.140 --> 00:58:03.980
DMing people.

1400
00:58:04.260 --> 00:58:04.680
Yes.

1401
00:58:05.460 --> 00:58:10.220
It usually ends up with the person somehow receiving money.

1402
00:58:10.380 --> 00:58:12.600
And that's what's going to happen in this next scene.

1403
00:58:13.540 --> 00:58:16.460
Esmeralda is going to keep sending money to Jarson.

1404
00:58:16.720 --> 00:58:17.420
So much.

1405
00:58:17.500 --> 00:58:18.600
It made me so uncomfortable.

1406
00:58:18.600 --> 00:58:23.680
That scene where she just keeps clicking send, and she's sending him 50 bucks at a pop.

1407
00:58:24.220 --> 00:58:26.580
Oh, and Ned is like, please stop, stop.

1408
00:58:26.880 --> 00:58:27.640
I was with Ned.

1409
00:58:27.780 --> 00:58:28.320
I was cringing.

1410
00:58:28.840 --> 00:58:30.600
She sent him $450.

1411
00:58:30.800 --> 00:58:32.060
I counted the dinks.

1412
00:58:32.080 --> 00:58:32.420
Yeah.

1413
00:58:32.780 --> 00:58:36.340
So much money in like the course of 12 seconds.

1414
00:58:37.060 --> 00:58:39.680
She thinks that this is how she's taking care of him.

1415
00:58:39.920 --> 00:58:41.420
This is how she's rationalizing it.

1416
00:58:41.640 --> 00:58:45.940
You know, I know he needs me, and I'm caring for him, and this is going to make him happy.

1417
00:58:46.040 --> 00:58:47.060
And he makes me happy.

1418
00:58:47.300 --> 00:58:52.560
Well, one of the things Nicole's been busy doing is she has bought a cameo from Josh

1419
00:58:52.560 --> 00:58:55.400
Holloway, and she's going to play it for everyone.

1420
00:58:55.400 --> 00:58:58.200
This is her final takedown of Esmeralda.

1421
00:58:58.320 --> 00:58:59.120
Let's hear it.

1422
00:59:00.600 --> 00:59:01.480
Hello, Esmeralda.

1423
00:59:02.420 --> 00:59:07.660
It's me, Josh Holloway from Lost, Yellowstone, and that underseen show Colony.

1424
00:59:07.900 --> 00:59:13.860
Anyway, your coworker, Nicole, bought this for you on Cameo so you could hear it from me.

1425
00:59:15.140 --> 00:59:16.440
I'm not Jarson.

1426
00:59:17.160 --> 00:59:18.220
I'm Josh Holloway.

1427
00:59:18.820 --> 00:59:20.160
I'm not your boyfriend.

1428
00:59:20.720 --> 00:59:22.380
I don't know how our wires got crossed.

1429
00:59:22.480 --> 00:59:24.120
I just say what they tell me to say on here.

1430
00:59:24.420 --> 00:59:26.040
But we're not in love.

1431
00:59:26.660 --> 00:59:28.240
I'm in love with my wife, Jessica.

1432
00:59:29.420 --> 00:59:30.180
I'm sorry.

1433
00:59:30.800 --> 00:59:31.160
Mahalo.

1434
00:59:33.200 --> 00:59:37.160
I did love that the camera quickly panned to Oscar when he said mahalo.

1435
00:59:37.480 --> 00:59:37.880
Yeah.

1436
00:59:38.540 --> 00:59:39.660
Oscar's like, I knew it.

1437
00:59:39.680 --> 00:59:40.200
I knew it.

1438
00:59:41.560 --> 00:59:44.740
Esmeralda is just visibly shaken by this.

1439
00:59:44.800 --> 00:59:45.800
She is convinced.

1440
00:59:46.020 --> 00:59:46.520
Thank God.

1441
00:59:46.960 --> 00:59:47.960
She's like, oh.

1442
00:59:48.520 --> 00:59:48.780
Yeah.

1443
00:59:48.780 --> 00:59:50.800
And she's humiliated.

1444
00:59:51.020 --> 00:59:51.200
Yeah.

1445
00:59:51.940 --> 00:59:55.720
And this episode is going to end with Esmeralda up on the roof.

1446
00:59:55.920 --> 00:59:56.920
She's watching LoSt.

1447
00:59:57.240 --> 00:59:58.180
And cursing.

1448
00:59:58.340 --> 01:00:00.020
She's saying a bunch of stuff in Italian.

1449
01:00:00.200 --> 01:00:02.120
I don't know what, but she's not happy.

1450
01:00:02.480 --> 01:00:02.780
Yeah.

1451
01:00:03.080 --> 01:00:04.400
And Ned is going to go up there.

1452
